@startuml
title Ingest / Knowledge / QA 关系图（代码实现视角）

' Scope:
' - 子域职责边界
' - 数据流向与依赖方向
' - 已实现 API 的挂载位置

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Client" as Client

rectangle "Ingest Domain\n(文档资产生命周期)" as Ingest {
  usecase "POST /api/v1/documents/upload" as UC_Upload
  usecase "GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/status" as UC_Status
  usecase "GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/chunks/preview" as UC_Preview
  usecase "POST /api/v1/documents/{id}/reprocess" as UC_Reprocess
  usecase "DELETE /api/v1/documents/{id}" as UC_Delete
}

rectangle "Knowledge Domain\n(主数据管理与统计视图)" as Knowledge {
  usecase "POST /api/v1/knowledge-bases" as UC_KB_Create
  usecase "GET /api/v1/knowledge-bases" as UC_KB_List
  usecase "PATCH /api/v1/knowledge-bases/{kbId}" as UC_KB_Update
}

rectangle "QA Domain\n(检索与回答编排)" as QA {
  usecase "POST /api/v1/qa/ask" as UC_Ask
}

database "ingest_documents\n(状态与元数据)" as TableDocs
database "knowledge_bases\n(知识库主数据)" as TableKB
database "PGVector\n(文档 chunk 向量)" as VDB

Client --> Ingest
Client --> Knowledge
Client --> QA

Ingest --> TableDocs : 写入/推进状态
Ingest --> VDB : 写入/删除向量

Knowledge --> TableKB : 读写主数据
Knowledge --> TableDocs : 聚合 INDEXED 统计
QA --> VDB : TopK 检索
QA --> TableDocs : 读取必要元数据

note right of Knowledge
当前代码口径：
- 维护知识库主数据
- 叠加 INDEXED 文档统计
end note

note bottom of Ingest
Ingest 是上游事实来源：
Knowledge 与 QA 均消费其产物
end note

@enduml
